1
00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:02.850
[S01] For me, it's like I have done something wrong.

2
00:00:02.879 --> 00:00:06.719
[S01] So, once you've asked these four questions and you've gathered the awareness,

3
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.210
[S01] the second step is reflect.

4
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:08.439
[S02] Yes.

5
00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:08.910
[S01] What do you do?

6
00:00:08.939 --> 00:00:11.970
[S02] So, reflection, if you think of a reflection, you look at yourself in the mirror,

7
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.619
[S02] you see the reflection of yourself.

8
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.320
[S02] There's also the concept of a reflection of light through a prism.

9
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.820
[S02] If you shine a white light through a prism, it comes out with, yes.

10
00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:21.769
[S02] So, there's depth and there's reflection.

11
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:27.570
[S02] So, you're reflecting on how is, how am I seeing myself in relation to those four questions?

12
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.730
[S02] You keep very organized, don't jump all over.

13
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:33.219
[S02] So, you say, you reflect on why am I seeing myself this way?

14
00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.179
[S02] And what does it mean?

15
00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:37.140
[S02] So, you look in the mirror and you go deep.

16
00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:41.149
[S02] Why, and you use the WH question, so who, the what, the when, the where, the why, the how.

17
00:00:41.179 --> 00:00:42.049
[S01] Okay, so how do I do that?

18
00:00:42.079 --> 00:00:44.409
[S02] So, why am I feeling like this in this moment?

19
00:00:44.439 --> 00:00:47.409
[S02] Why am I specifically feeling it in my stomach?

20
00:00:47.439 --> 00:00:50.210
[S02] Is it always in my stomach when I feel this?

21
00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:51.859
[S02] Where is this happening?

22
00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:53.119
[S02] Is it only happening at work?

23
00:00:53.149 --> 00:00:54.060
[S02] Is it happening before?

24
00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:56.859
[S02] How often, how often is it happening?

25
00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.659
[S02] Is it happening every day or just now and then?

26
00:00:58.689 --> 00:01:00.009
[S02] So, you just start the process.

27
00:01:00.039 --> 00:01:02.770
[S02] You're not going to solve it all, but it's very specific.

28
00:01:02.799 --> 00:01:06.180
[S02] I'm looking at myself in the mirror and reflecting back and I'm going deep.

29
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.939
[S02] Who, when, where, what, why, how.

30
00:01:08.969 --> 00:01:09.230
[S01] Got it.

31
00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:13.180
[S02] You don't have to answer all of them, but what makes sense to one.

32
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:18.340
[S02] Now, those two, three steps, people are pretty good at the meditation, the breathing, all that stuff.

33
00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:20.980
[S02] They're pretty good at saying how they feel.

34
00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:22.569
[S02] That's where, but that's when people crash.

35
00:01:22.599 --> 00:01:24.120
[S01] Well, it's true, like people who go to therapy.
